<title>GERMANY: German motor office details June registrations.</title>
<headline>German motor office details June registrations.</headline>
<dateline>FLENSBURG, Germany 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Federal Motor Office issued the following information on Saturday on new vehicle registrations in Germany during June.</p>
<p>				June 1997    June 1996</p>
<p>    Volkswagen	    62,770	 65,782</p>
<p>    Opel		    55,038	 50,991</p>
<p>    Ford		    43,436	 30,030</p>
<p>    BMW		     23,858	 20,428</p>
<p>    Audi		    19,671	 18,614</p>
<p>    Mercedes		24,663	 22,816</p>
<p>    Seat		    5,530	  5,806</p>
<p>    Skoda		   1,878	  2,050</p>
<p>    Porsche		 1,152	  557</p>
<p>				Jan-June 97  Jan-June 96</p>
<p>    Volkswagen	    334,024	371,478</p>
<p>    Opel		    286,639	311,747</p>
<p>    Ford		    207,647	190,878</p>
<p>    BMW		     120,608	116,904</p>
<p>    Audi		    125,640	111,574</p>
<p>    Mercedes		144,236	150,682</p>
<p>    Seat		    29,745	 27,579</p>
<p>    Skoda		   12,751	 11,130</p>
<p>    Porsche		 6,681	  3,654</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
